<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Karsai & Pénzes (1993) J. Theor. Biol., Theraulaz & Bonabeau (1995) Science & Smith et al. (2021) PNAS stigmergic hexagonal wasp comb architecture, shared-wall pulp economy & 5-7 topological disclination pairs — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
