<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Karsai & Pénzes (1993) J. Theor. Biol., Theraulaz & Bonabeau (1995) Science & Smith et al. (2021) PNAS stigmergic hexagonal wasp comb architecture, shared-wall pulp economy & 5-7 topological disclination pairs — Model fidelity to source: 57/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes centered hexagonal cell counts N(R) = 1 + 3R(R+1), total shared walls W(R) = 3N(R) + 6R + 3, and pulp savings S_saved(R) = 6N(R) - W(R) (L34-53), backed by 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_096_social_wasp_comb_hexagons.lean`. However, `generate_deterministic_hex_rings` (L56-68) enumerates concentric rings deterministically without simulating the stochastic Boltzmann wall-sharing rule P(k) ~ exp(beta*k), and lacks topological 5-7 disclination pairs at caste size transitions." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "1998-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons.py L56–L68: Deterministic ring enumeration instead of stochastic Boltzmann P(k) ~ exp(beta*k) pocket selection and 5-7 defect relaxation <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/e93f00e/1998-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons.py#L56-L68>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.7e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bonabeau-social-wasp-comb-hexagons-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Karsai & Pénzes (1993) J. Theor. Biol., Theraulaz & Bonabeau (1995) Science & Smith et al. (2021) PNAS stigmergic hexagonal wasp comb architecture, shared-wall pulp economy & 5-7 topological disclination pairs — Morphometric validation: 52/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L175-210) reports only 4 analytic ring ratios without Pearson r, p-value, RMSE, stigmergic selectivity beta correlation, Eden random vs wild-type wall-per-cell delta, 5-7 disclination dipole net Euler charge, or specimen brood cell coordination number <z>." ;
